1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,118
After court, open the Board.

2
00:00:03,168 --> 00:00:12,552
A case whose date has passed waits for an update.

3
00:00:12,602 --> 00:00:16,719
Choose what happened, and who asked for time.

4
00:00:16,769 --> 00:00:26,421
Pick the next date. +14 days is one tap.

5
00:00:26,471 --> 00:00:33,447
Tap Save. The case moves to its new date.
